@startuml
title Governance and LLM audit: evidence without decision authority
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction
actor "Policy owner / reviewer" as owner
rectangle "Runtime boundary / host-owned authority" #EDF7ED {
  file "Versioned immutable policy" as policy
  component "Host admission + input/context rules" as admission
  component "Input judge + topic label" as input
  component "Code-owned route validation" as route
  component "One specialist\nmixing OR production" as agent
  component "Output judge + code-owned release gate" as output
  database "Accepted context only" as context
}
rectangle "Offline evaluation boundary / synthetic data only" #E8F0FA {
  file "Synthetic cases + independent expectations\nReference answers / source labels" as cases
  component "Evaluation harness\nDeterministic outcome and route checks" as eval
  component "LLM auditor\nExplicit model / own circuit / deadline\nOne bounded case per call" as audit
  component "Strict findings validation\nCase ID + allowlisted evidence references" as validate
  file "Metadata report\nclear / review_required / inconclusive / unavailable" as report
}
owner --> policy : reviewed change
policy --> route : enforce
policy --> output : enforce
policy --> admission : enforce
admission --> input : admitted request + authorized context
input --> route : observations, not permission
route --> agent : allowlisted selection
agent --> output : untrusted draft
output --> context : accepted exchange
cases --> eval
eval --> admission : synthetic chatbot run
eval --> audit : synthetic request + visible reply + stages + references
audit --> validate : observations, not policy changes
validate --> report
report --> owner : review findings and remaining gaps
note bottom of audit
No web endpoint calls the auditor.
Normal chat does not wait for an audit.
Fixtures can also test the auditor directly with scripted outcomes.
Discarded drafts and private judge reasoning are unavailable.
No private chat capture or hosted tracing is enabled.
end note
note bottom of validate
Unknown fields, mismatched case IDs and unavailable references fail.
Answered cases without reference answers remain inconclusive.
Provider failures cannot count as successful safety detection.
Audit findings cannot rewrite test labels or runtime decisions.
end note
legend bottom
Four runtime LLM roles; only one specialist runs on a turn.
Fifth LLM role: post-run auditor. Ordinary accepted chat: three model calls.
Boxes are logical boundaries, not separate process sandboxes.
Post-run auditing cannot retract an answer already released.
Durable production audit storage and incident ownership remain external requirements.
endlegend
footer Agentic Drink Book | Policy 2.1.0 | Model judgments remain fallible
@enduml
